%% DM26-0670

sequenceDiagram
    participant Trigger
    participant Infra as InfrastructureSupervisor
    participant Domain as domain supervisor
    participant Children as domain children
    participant InfraChildren as infra children
    participant Process as process

    autonumber
    Note over Trigger,Domain: Triggers: health verdict (rejuvenation or hard deadline),<br/>unexpected death of health, router, Cassini client or crypto,<br/>SIGTERM or SIGINT from the kubelet
    Trigger->>Infra: reason
    Note over Infra: begin_shutdown(reason)<br/>log the reason, ignore repeats
    Infra->>Infra: start watchdog (bounded budget)
    Infra->>Domain: InfrastructureEvent::PrepareShutdown

    Domain->>Children: stop and drain (bounded)
    Children-->>Domain: stopped
    Domain->>Infra: ProceedWithShutdown

    Infra->>InfraChildren: stop (bounded)<br/>health, router, tcp client, crypto
    InfraChildren-->>Infra: terminated
    Infra->>Process: exit non-zero (never 0)
    Note over Infra,Process: Job replaces the pod,<br/>polar-init issues fresh certs

    alt domain supervisor never answers
        Note over Infra: watchdog expires
        Infra->>Process: exit 1
    end
